{
  "name": "typst-math-suite",
  "displayName": "Typst Math Suite",
  "description": "在 Typst 数学环境（$ … $）里输入触发词即时展开；内置希腊字母、导数积分、极限求和等规则，规则表可自由增删改。",
  "version": "0.0.1",
  "publisher": "illusion",
  "license": "MIT",
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.80.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Snippets"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "typst",
    "math",
    "snippet",
    "latex",
    "completion"
  ],
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/Thomas-key/typst-math-suite.git"
  },
  "files": [
    "extension.js",
    "rules.jsonc",
    "README.md",
    "README.en.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "main": "./extension.js",
  "activationEvents": [
    "onLanguage:typst"
  ],
  "contributes": {
    "configuration": {
      "title": "Typst Math Suite",
      "properties": {
        "typstMathSuite.inMathRules": {
          "type": "object",
          "default": {},
          "markdownDescription": "数学环境（`$ … $`）内的规则：`触发词 → 替换`。\n\n内置规则在扩展目录的 `rules.jsonc` 里，可直接编辑（支持注释）。这里写同名键会**覆盖**内置，写新键就是**新增**规则。",
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "typstMathSuite.outMathRules": {
          "type": "object",
          "default": {},
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "markdownDescription": "数学环境**外**的规则：`触发词 → 替换`。同名键会覆盖 `rules.jsonc` 里的内置规则。"
        },
        "typstMathSuite.inMathRegexRules": {
          "type": "object",
          "default": {},
          "markdownDescription": "数学环境内的**正则**规则：`正则 → 替换`。`{1}` `{2}` 引用捕获组，`$1` `$0` 是停靠点。",
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "typstMathSuite.outMathRegexRules": {
          "type": "object",
          "default": {},
          "markdownDescription": "数学环境外的**正则**规则：`正则 → 替换`。",
          "additionalProperties": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
